(text "5V BUCK CONVERTER - TPSM365R3 (12V/24V in, 5V out, 300 mA max)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 48.26 50.80 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f12f03a8-ddea-4301-a227-04166cf32c22"))
(text "Follows TI WEBENCH design (WBDesign1.pdf): Fsw = 1 MHz (RT tied to VCC), Vout = 1V x (1 + 40.2k/10k) = 5.02V" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 48.26 57.15 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "2fccb866-adb1-4c23-8217-9ab85db11d8e"))
(text "NOTE: In WEBENCH the far-left vertical line is the Vin SOURCE and the far-right one is the Iout LOAD." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 48.26 60.96 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ddfbe5e3-c43e-4d29-9655-5c03e59b9855"))
(text "They are NOT wires. The +12V / +5V power symbols replace them. Never draw a wire from +12V or +5V to GND." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 48.26 64.77 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c357097f-19a2-4b65-bdb7-608f49d58c8a"))
(text "BOOT: leave open (100nF boot cap is inside the module).  SW pins: leave open, minimum copper (datasheet)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 48.26 68.58 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "6ffa1fc7-6316-435a-a043-dbea44765810"))
(text "EN tied to VIN = always on.  PGOOD pulled up to VOUT through R1 (optional status signal)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 48.26 72.39 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "74941e81-b059-4106-87d2-792da6ac7b6b"))
(text "INPUT CAPACITORS - place right next to the VIN/GND pins" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 48.26 128.27 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "84373d0b-3331-4885-9dea-ddd545238ec8"))
(text "OUTPUT + FEEDBACK - keep FB trace short" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 177.80 121.92 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "dcb3a7fe-8829-4c9a-9229-737ac5a106d2"))
(text "C21 is extra vs WEBENCH: datasheet needs 25uF effective Cout at 5V. Mark DNP to match WEBENCH exactly." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 134.62 157.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c75bc45e-5e44-4f7d-b798-7af12cd2efb0"))
